00:00:26,319 --> 00:00:29,370
which are represented by the stone in the picture,

9
00:00:29,379 --> 00:00:33,630
and the best coping way is to confront and remove them.

10
00:00:33,639 --> 00:00:38,340
Life is full of challenges and difficulties to every individual.

11
00:00:38,349 --> 00:00:43,260
Some people with a strong will can withstand the test of adversities,

12
00:00:43,269 --> 00:00:48,840
while others who are not ready for the battle against plight do nothing but surrender.

13
00:00:48,849 --> 00:00:51,470
Take college students for example.

14
00:00:51,479 --> 00:00:54,970
In addition to increased competition in the job market,

15
00:00:54,979 --> 00:00:59,670
complicated personal relationships and high expectations from parents

16
00:00:59,679 --> 00:01:04,040
have imposed on them an invisible pressure and anxiety.

17
00:01:04,049 --> 00:01:11,150
A few students are so overwhelmed by pessimism that they put an end to their young lives.

18
00:01:11,159 --> 00:01:12,570
What a pity!

19
00:01:12,579 --> 00:01:17,160
They could have avoided the tragedy if they had mustered up their courage to face

20
00:01:17,169 --> 00:01:20,670
and overcome these seemingly insurmountable hardships.

21
00:01:20,679 --> 00:01:24,930
We grow more mature by learning how to handle difficulties.

22
00:01:24,939 --> 00:01:26,930
And only the mature and unyielding people will survive in the harsh reality.

